380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 627 0 R
/E (Extracts a set of statistical features from an input image and comparing them to a pre-trained model. These features capture statistics related to natural images, such as contrast, sharpness, texture, and noise. Doesn't need a GT to compare with.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
