>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 631 0 R
/E (VGGPerceptual loss utilizes a pre-trained VGG network to extract features from the generated and target images. It measures the perceptual difference \(Euclidean distance\) between images. By considering higher-level features, such as textures, colors, and object shapes, it encourages the generated images to match the target images in terms of visual appearance.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
